1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
Cutest Pet in Marathon County:
a reader contest, Nov. 14 to Dec. 5.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,555
Enter free and back pets with vote packs.
Half of sales goes to Moments.

3
00:00:03,555 --> 00:00:05,555
Enter your pet free,
with one phone photo.

4
00:00:05,555 --> 00:00:07,555
An editor checks every entry
before it goes live.

5
00:00:07,555 --> 00:00:10,555
Readers back their favorites
with vote packs.

6
00:00:10,555 --> 00:00:13,555
The top 16 make the bracket.
Totals reset every round.

7
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:16,555
Half of every vote pack goes
to Moments Foster Care.

8
00:00:16,555 --> 00:00:19,555
WPR pays the card fees,
and packs start at $5.

9
00:00:19,555 --> 00:00:21,555
Then the top 16 go head to head.

10
00:00:21,555 --> 00:00:23,555
Every matchup starts at zero.

11
00:00:23,555 --> 00:00:25,555
Who will be crowned Dec. 5?

12
00:00:25,555 --> 00:00:28,000
Entries open Saturday, Nov. 14.
Enter free at wausaupilotandreview.com.

13
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Vote packs are not donations.
Example screens: sample pets and numbers.
